{"id":"msg_m_event_doutsiders_01_s","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_syuen_s","label":"Syuen · Chat"},"label":"10. Hey.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_event_hightechtoy_05_e","next":"msg_m_main_24_03","speakers":{"syuen":"Syuen"},"icons":{"syuen":"si_c901_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_1","text":"Hey.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_2","text":"So you're going to pay our friends at Exotic a visit?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_3","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_4","text":"Hehe, oh boy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_5","text":"Our company made them, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_6","text":"How should I put this...","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_7","text":"They're not exactly in perfect working order.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_8","text":"They're like untrained dogs who bite the hand that feeds them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_9","text":"So I devised a small contraption to help keep them in line.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_10","text":"It's an app called \"ExoticController\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_11","text":"Make sure you download it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_12","text":"... I download the app.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_13","text":"What is this?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_14","text":"With this app, with just one tap of the finger,","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_15","text":"and their heads will go kaboom like a cantaloupe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_16","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_17","text":"Relax, will you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_18","text":"Don't get your undies in a twist.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_19","text":"It cost me a fortune to make that squad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_20","text":"I'd hate to see that money go to waste.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_21","text":"Only use it as a last resort.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_22","text":"If those rust buckets end up turning on you,","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_23","text":"at least you've got an easy way out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_24","text":"Got it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_event_doutsiders_01_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"syuen","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_event_doutsiders_01_s_25","text":"Hehe","jump":null}],"chat":true}